    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area : 86.96 sqm\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this very fine 3 bedroomed semi-detached home which is ready for immediate occupation. Situated on a mature road in a tranquil setting and within walking distance of all amenities. 31 Luttrell Park Drive offers a blank canvas opportunity for a discerning purchaser to secure a home that offers wonderful balance in living and sleeping accommodation.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hall with under stair storage, bright and well- proportioned living room that interconnects with kitchen/breakfast room with double doors to the rear garden. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms, and a family bathroom which completes the accommodation.\n\nOutside there is off-street parking to the front and a lawned garden leads to a side passage with gated side entrance to the walled rear garden laid in lawn. The property is not directly overlooked to the front. It`s location in this quiet cul-de-sac with a large green at the end of the road makes it ideal for young children to safely play. Proximity to schools and shops including St. Patrick`s National School & Castleknock Community School ensure the ultimate convenient location to set up home. Coolmine Train Station is less than a 5-minute walk. Commuting to and from the city centre and further afield is also made easier by the easy access to the M50. \n\nViewing is an absolute must."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.7m (5'7\") x 4.4m (14'5\")\nwith tiled floor, alarm panel, understair storage\n\nLounge / Reception 1 - 3.27m (10'9\") x 5.04m (16'6\")\nwith laminate wood floor, feature fireplace with timber surround and wood burning stove\n\nDiningroom - 5.07m (16'8\") x 3.03m (9'11\")\nwith tiled floor, double doors to rear garden\n\nKitchen - 2.34m (7'8\") x 2.66m (8'9\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan.\n\nLanding - 2.1m (6'11\") x 3.04m (10'0\")\nwith carpet, access to attic, hotpress\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.87m (9'5\") x 4.11m (13'6\")\nto the front of house with laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.87m (9'5\") x 3.34m (10'11\")\nto the rear of house with laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.1m (6'11\") x 2.7m (8'10\")\nto the front of house with laminate wood floor\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.75m (5'9\") x 1.62m (5'4\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., shower cubicle with electric shower, fully tiled"
      },
      {
